usage: run_optimized.py [-h] [--threads THREADS] [--label LABEL]
                        [--binary BINARY] [--runtime RUNTIME]
                        [--rust-prefix RUST_PREFIX]

Run the exact fixed-input optimized model with cache preload and shared oracle
checks.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --threads THREADS
  --label LABEL
  --binary BINARY       reuse an already built optimized executable
  --runtime RUNTIME     fresh scratch directory for a reproducible offline
                        build
  --rust-prefix RUST_PREFIX
                        installed Rust 1.94.1 prefix; required when building
